LID - CD016334
AB  - This is a protocol for a Cochrane Review (prognosis). The objectives are as 
      follows: To identify and evaluate AI-based prognostic models, in development and 
      external validation studies, which predict impending episodes of ventricular 
      tachycardia from continuous surface electrocardiogram (ECG) recordings in 
