LID - 102968
AB  - Artificial intelligence-enhanced electrocardiogram has emerged as an effective 
      tool for the detection and prognostication of cardiac amyloidosis. In this 
      series, we present 4 cases that demonstrate the potential of the artificial 
      intelligence-enhanced electrocardiogram as a useful tool for monitoring treatment 
      response in cardiac amyloidosis.
