TI  - Deep learning and electrocardiography: systematic review of current techniques in 
      cardiovascular disease diagnosis and management.
PG  - 23
LID - 10.1186/s12938-025-01349-w [doi]
LID - 23
AB  - This paper reviews the recent advancements in the application of deep learning 
      combined with electrocardiography (ECG) within the domain of cardiovascular 
      diseases, systematically examining 198 high-quality publications. Through 
      meticulous categorization and hierarchical segmentation, it provides an 
      exhaustive depiction of the current landscape across various cardiovascular 
      ailments. Our study aspires to furnish interested readers with a comprehensive 
      guide, thereby igniting enthusiasm for further, in-depth exploration and research 
      in this realm.
