      based on an in-house AI model in 150 individuals (PMID: 32531719). Furthermore, 
      we analyzed 240 participants with the same AI algorithm regarding aorta 
      measurements, where we compared AI measurements to manual reading (PMID: 
      37659209). Methodology: Retrospective analysis of a prospective study Diagnostic 
      study Performed at one institution
