TI  - Advancing Cardiovascular Risk Assessment with Artificial Intelligence: 
      Opportunities and Implications in North Carolina.
LID - 10.18043/001c.91424 [doi]
AB  - Cardiovascular disease mortality is increasing in North Carolina with persistent 
      inequality by race, income, and location. Artificial intelligence (AI) can 
      repurpose the widely available electrocardiogram (ECG) for enhanced assessment of 
      cardiac dysfunction. By identifying accelerated cardiac aging from the ECG, AI 
      offers novel insights into risk assessment and prevention.
